# NEXT IT Technologies — environment variables
#
# This is a static marketing site with no backend dependency required to
# build or deploy. The one optional variable below wires up the contact
# ("Request a Quote") form to a real submission endpoint.

# Optional. Base44 has been removed, so this site has no backend of its own.
# If you want the quote form on /contact to POST somewhere (Formspree, a
# Cloudflare Worker, an email API, etc.) instead of falling back to
# WhatsApp/email links, set this to that endpoint's URL.
# VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
